      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.99,
      "end_seconds": 22.8,
      "duration_seconds": 8.81,
      "text": "mainly pain in my breastbone wound. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.81,
      "end_seconds": 26.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "when did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.35,
      "end_seconds": 30.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "probably about two weeks yeah"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.11,
      "end_seconds": 41.18,
      "duration_seconds": 10.07,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.8,
      "end_seconds": 53.84,
      "duration_seconds": 11.04,
      "text": "pretty severe if I'm being honest. Yes coughing. That makes it worse. I just want to get back to normal really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.83,
      "end_seconds": 58.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "right does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.92,
      "end_seconds": 75.5,
      "duration_seconds": 14.58,
      "text": "It usually comes with a clicking in the breastbone. The clicking in the breastbone? That's been for two days. With clicking in the breastbone, I'd say severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.55,
      "end_seconds": 92.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Any breathlessness or chest pain on exertion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.49,
      "end_seconds": 97.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "no, no breathlessness or chest pain on exertion"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.07,
      "end_seconds": 103.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.32,
      "end_seconds": 107.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "no, that side's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.32,
      "end_seconds": 116.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.77,
      "end_seconds": 124.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "my heart's been fine, um, as far as I know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.77,
      "end_seconds": 127.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.76,
      "end_seconds": 134.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "no surgery no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.62,
      "end_seconds": 149.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "alright, do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.55,
      "end_seconds": 153.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "not really uh no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.1,
      "end_seconds": 158.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.75,
      "end_seconds": 162.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "no allergies at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.02,
      "end_seconds": 167.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.82,
      "end_seconds": 170.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "no, nothing at the moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.16,
      "end_seconds": 183.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.59,
      "end_seconds": 197.72,
      "duration_seconds": 14.13,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. No, I share a house with my brother. I hardly move around during the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.74,
      "end_seconds": 203.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.74,
      "end_seconds": 220.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "sit still for a a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.85,
      "end_seconds": 247.2,
      "duration_seconds": 13.35,
      "text": "okay: pressure 121 over 75, weight 92 kilos, height 178 centimetres, temperature 36.5, saturation 98 percent, pulse is 65 beats a minute, respiratory rate 14."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.97,
      "end_seconds": 252.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "let's move on to the examination"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.27,
      "end_seconds": 268.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "yeah, no problem"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.99,
      "end_seconds": 272.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.94,
      "end_seconds": 298.79,
      "duration_seconds": 9.85,
      "text": "the chest wound has healed, the breastbone is stable, and the vein-harvest wound on the leg is a little swollen"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.72,
      "end_seconds": 315.32,
      "duration_seconds": 12.6,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Putting it all together, this is probably recovering well after bypass surgery. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.88,
      "end_seconds": 318.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.07,
      "end_seconds": 335.27,
      "duration_seconds": 15.2,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency it looks like recovering well after bypass surgery, but I'd like to confirm i think an ECG makes sense here, for post-operative review"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 340.31,
      "end_seconds": 344.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "we have a slot Friday at 10 am, if that works"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.35,
      "end_seconds": 369.43,
      "duration_seconds": 23.08,
      "text": "walk daily no heavy lifting for six weeks and no driving until you are cleared try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day and keep your phone away from the bed i'll want another look in six weeks is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.58,
      "end_seconds": 373.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "ah I think I understand everything thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.61,
      "end_seconds": 375.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
